references.description:
Entity ids were taken over, so everything that uses entities keeps working. Things that use a **device id** (device triggers/actions, `target: device_id`) still point to the old ZHA device:

{report}

Replacing rewrites the old device ids in `automations.yaml`, `scripts.yaml` and `scenes.yaml` (a backup is created) and reloads them. `domain: zha` device triggers and `zha_event` triggers must be rebuilt by hand (e.g. with the Zigbee2MQTT `action` sensor/event).
